# Testing Strategy Rules
- Write unit tests for assessment scoring algorithms (handling partial marks, negative marking).
- Write unit tests for subscription entitlement matching and expiration checks.
- Mock eSewa and Khalti external endpoints; verify signature hashing (HMAC-SHA256) matches sandbox specifications.
- Never write tests that bypass real authorization guards without testing the rejection path first.
